---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — Pulse Purse"
  description="The terms for using Pulse Purse."
>
  <Header />
  <main class="container legal">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: October 2026</p>
    <p>
      These terms apply when you use Pulse Purse, a personal finance app operated by Crafton Tech.
      By creating an account or using the app you agree to them.
    </p>

    <h2>Your account</h2>
    <p>
      You are responsible for the information you provide, for keeping your sign-in details
      secure, and for activity on your account. You must be old enough to form a binding
      agreement where you live. You can delete your account at any time from the Profile screen.
    </p>

    <h2>What Pulse Purse is, and is not</h2>
    <p>
      Pulse Purse helps you record and understand your own income, expenses, budgets and plans. The
      totals, forecasts and projections it shows are calculated from what you enter and are for
      your information only. They are not financial, tax, legal or investment advice, and the app
      does not move money or connect to your bank.
    </p>

    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>
      Do not misuse the service: no attempts to access other people's data, to disrupt or overload
      the service, to reverse engineer it, or to use it for anything unlawful. We may suspend
      accounts that do.
    </p>

    <h2>Your data</h2>
    <p>
      Your records belong to you. You give us permission to store and process them only to provide
      the service, as described in our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Availability and changes</h2>
    <p>
      We work to keep the app available and accurate but cannot promise it will always be
      uninterrupted or error-free. We may change or discontinue features, and will give notice
      of significant changes where we reasonably can.
    </p>

    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>
      The service is provided "as is". To the extent permitted by law, Crafton Tech is not liable
      for indirect or consequential losses, or for decisions you make based on figures shown in the
      app. Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited by law.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>If we update these terms we will change the date above. Continuing to use the app after that means you accept the update.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions: <a href="/contact">pulsepurse.app/contact</a>.</p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
<style>
  .legal { padding-block: 4rem; max-width: 680px; }
  .legal h1 { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .legal h2 { margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .legal p, .legal li { line-height: 1.65; }
  .legal ul { padding-left: 1.25rem; }
</style>
